   "printed_answer": null,
   "verified_answer": "（1）∵AB=CB，BE=BF，且AB⊥BC，F在AB延长线上，∴∠ABE=∠CBF=90°。由SAS得△ABE≌△CBF。\n（2）等腰直角△ABC中，∠ACB=∠CAB=45°。又∠CAE=30°，在△ACE中，∠ACE=45°，∴∠AEC=105°，从而∠AEB=75°。由（1）全等得∠CFB=∠AEB=75°。因A、B、F共线，∠AFC=75°。于是∠ACF=180°-∠CAF-∠AFC=180°-45°-75°=60°。故∠ACF=60°。",
   "verify_status": "pass",
   "mistake_reason": {
    "kind": "unknown",
    "note": ""
